<section class="explore-capacity" aria-labelledby="explore-capacity-heading">
  <h2 id="explore-capacity-heading">Start creating with Explore</h2>
  <p>Develop one active project with up to ten active cards. Save your work, return to it and keep revising your cards as your ideas grow.</p>
  <p>Deleting a card makes room for another. Create gives you room to develop beyond Explore's capacity while keeping your existing work.</p>
